    "finalName": "",
    "description": "<p>Medpacs are compact packages designed to both equip a trained medic for work in the field and allow untrained individuals to apply <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/First_Aid\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"First Aid\">First Aid</a> in emergencies. A Medpac contains bandages, Bacta, synthetic flesh, coagulants, stimulants, and other medicines designed to help an injured patient recover quickly. </p><p>Once you use a Medpac, its contents are expended even if your <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Treat_Injury\" title=\"Treat Injury\">Treat Injury</a> check is not successful. Any given creature can only benefit from the use of a Medpac once in a 24-hour period. </p>",
